      "content": "I understand the pain and confusion you are feeling when you feel like life has no meaning.\nPlease know that suicide is not a logical solution to suffering and that you are not alone in these feelings.\nI encourage you to reach out to a crisis support line or a mental health professional who can help you find hope and support.\nYou deserve to feel better and I am here to help you connect with resources.",
      "source": "target",
